abstract: >-
  A modular and containerized orchestrator for assessing research software
  quality. It uses n8n and RabbitMQ to coordinate incremental metadata
  extraction with SOCA and SOMEF, FAIR quality assessments with RSFC and
  RESQUI, metadata checks with sw-metadata-bot and RsMetaCheck, publication
  to DashVERSE, and generation of a software catalogue portal.
keywords:
  - research software
  - software quality assessment
  - FAIR software
  - software metadata
  - workflow orchestration
  - incremental workflows
  - n8n
  - Docker
  - DashVERSE
